{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_4100_p", "source_sha256": "5f9997d5f36c8600c81dc616f01be57902fe8a318cc5d65dc6833fd198d8f637", "ja": "ああ、この後は、特に予定は入ってないけど……\nどこか行きたいところでもあるのか？　杏奈。", "zh": "嗯，我之后是没什么特别的安排……\n你有什么想去的地方吗？杏奈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_4101_024ann", "source_sha256": "c1d5625995b15f63b5b511437e655ac8cb0bee722f3703e8c09af24c75b2b5ea", "ja": "ん……えっと、そうじゃなくて……。\n昨日、面白そうなゲーム、見つけたから……。", "zh": "嗯……呃……不是那样的……\n昨天，杏奈找到了，很有趣的游戏……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_4102_024ann", "source_sha256": "886a201d40bd5e0b6a2a2221dced6ea777d55360381c7e883312dead886ca177", "ja": "杏奈、{$P$}さんと……\nん、と、その……。", "zh": "杏奈，想和{$P$}先生……\n嗯，啊，那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_4103_p", "source_sha256": "ddaf265f2815f2712532ecbc0db0d8e7adf4a0d064335ca018d6096f4b5b4db5", "ja": "へぇ、新作ゲームか！　杏奈のオススメってことは、\n面白いんだな。よし、一緒にやろうか。", "zh": "哦～新游戏啊！有杏奈的推荐就表示\n那游戏很有趣吧。好，一起玩吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_4104_024ann", "source_sha256": "e161d2d483463a46c91e3025d542f4d199f17df7703c9bd472f97a8862661ffb", "ja": "……！　うん……。\n……よろしく、お願いします……♪", "zh": "……！嗯……\n……请你，多多指教……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_4200_p", "source_sha256": "0d2ec1b495ab0a08a6d488e9dd79cac436147bdb28b79e136d66bc898cfdad12", "ja": "ああ、この後、打ち合わせが残ってるけど、\n少しなら大丈夫だぞ。何か、用事か？", "zh": "啊，我这之后还有事要讨论，\n只是一下子的话没问题喔。有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_4201_024ann", "source_sha256": "e84d7ebdc33aa2c1611b8db9712c7c334cb6759e46c6c3c197abea1ec8cb34af", "ja": "あ……えっと……このゲーム……すっごく\n面白いから、その……。", "zh": "啊……呃……这个游戏……非常，\n有趣，所以那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_4202_024ann", "source_sha256": "34ef2868a9f9162d21e29532b3c00c0fb07974f562b3c74c49fe9d48e2c2ea3c", "ja": "おススメだって……言いたくて……それだけ……。\n……今日は、お疲れさま、でした……！", "zh": "我想推荐……你玩……就这样……\n……今天，辛苦，你了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_4203_p", "source_sha256": "7527a2ea0873b289a84633728e8562ef0bcddbe0a8d2a87e374ccce5c0f4f466", "ja": "杏奈、ちょっと待った。\n時間があるなら、ちょっと遊んでいかないか？", "zh": "杏奈，等一下。\n我还有时间，要不要稍微玩一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_4204_024ann", "source_sha256": "318487892069cf4ab69be2ebbd36ff7c6357e395590494761c979f5e6ab92077", "ja": "……いい、の？　{$P$}さん……。\nじゃあ……少し、だけ……。", "zh": "……可以，吗？{$P$}先生……\n那……就，一下子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_4205_024ann", "source_sha256": "cb6512103e617a794a2d3d6dc41e57cfa830d7ed7f4ad58352ba48346d787748", "ja": "{$P$}さん、初めてだから……\n……杏奈……手かげん、してあげる……ね……♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，是第一次玩……\n……杏奈……会放水，给你的……喔……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_4300_p", "source_sha256": "9d1b00889e93dd5a52d8a28bd722bfc403d6859bbb423383facea18d6f6580fd", "ja": "すまない、杏奈。この後、ちょっと忙しくて……。\n何か、用事か？", "zh": "抱歉，杏奈。我接下来有点忙……\n有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_4301_024ann", "source_sha256": "8cbffe7a6c76578ee931e29b66db9739fbdca040e9dad953278cbef18e4ac123", "ja": "あ……お仕事があるなら、いいの……。\n杏奈のことは、大丈夫……。", "zh": "啊……有工作的话，就算了……\n杏奈，没有关系……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_4302_024ann", "source_sha256": "1037c20ca6ded3a91af82ecd4ac868d0a5cb1683102c38c05983b46001bfcbb2", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お仕事、頑張って……。\n杏奈、応援……してる……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，工作，加油……\n杏奈，会支持……你的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_024ann_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_024ann_4303_024ann", "source_sha256": "60ca9c291eeba01a48bf9c4e2f43de9504750f6a27179a38afd563deaaddf0ec", "ja": "杏奈、劇場にいるから……もし、早く終わったら……\n声、掛けてほしい……です。", "zh": "杏奈，就待在剧场里……如果，工作提早结束……\n希望，你可以来找……杏奈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
